  "body_html": "<h1>optAugA</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ndef optAugA (A : I → Fin n → 𝕜) (c : Fin n → 𝕜) : OptAugRow I n → Fin n → 𝕜 | Sum.inl (Sum.inl i), j =&gt; A i j | Sum.inl (Sum.inr j'), j =&gt; if j = j' then 1 else 0 | Sum.inr (), j =&gt; -c j /-- Optimality-augmented RHS. -/</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>OptAugRow</li>\n</ul>",
